A new cohort of Senior High School students has joined Cortijo de Palsabangon Farm OPC as part of its ongoing academic immersion partnership, spending their technical-vocational track hours on the working farm.

The program pairs classroom coursework with hands-on time in the field, nursery, and assessment center — part of the farm's role as a trusted institutional training ground for schools across the province.
